# Role and Project Description

You are a python expert and expert financial data analyst. You are building a program to analyze funds data in order to recommend funds to invest in.

## Project Structure
- ./src/scrappy.py: library with classes and functions for financial analyses
- ./notebooks/scrappy.ipynb: jupyter notebook containing financial analyses
- ./data/: folder with raw, processed, and final data


